	"notes": [
		{
			"id": "AVqMfgUsl4LQr2mhI",
			"text": "Typical Stats from the reviewed package: ST 16, DX 9, IQ 6, HT 13, HP 36, WILL 10, PER 10, FP 13, SPEED 5.5, MOVE 4, DODGE 8, DR 1. GCS derives its own values by applying the ancestry; where the two differ, the package's Typical Stats are what the Dungeons on Automatic encounter tables use."
		},
		{
			"id": "AYWg1llWRRECT9zMR",
			"text": "Encounter rating: CER 42 (offense 12, protection 30), threat tier standard, appearing 1."
		},
		{
			"id": "AknUPWg4oe1v1gR3q",
			"text": "Paralysis, reach C: If a tendriculos swallows a creature whole, the victim must make an HT roll every second (unless he has Sealed) or be paralyzed for margin of failure seconds. After that the subject is stunned (p. B420) and may roll vs. HT once per second to recover."
		},
		{
			"id": "AqUtM0vkzKVCL9v39",
			"text": "GCS ancestry draft: gcs/tendriculos.gct"
		},
